+
+This is Build Guide prompt 4.5 in manual mode (lean target of about 10 credits), with the roles corrected to D43. The Build Guide's "for Admin and Tax Partner" is replaced, because Admin never approves rules.
+- **Deferred:** Update Alerts with an AI summary and confidence, the alert detail screen, Watched sources, and "Check FTA now" (the automatic FTA monitor). The engine endpoints exist (`/v1/rules-monitor/...`), so they can be added later.
+- Firm-level decisions happen on page 11, Partner Review, which was built in 4.1. This page links to it rather than duplicating it.
+
+----------------------------------------------------------------
+Build Rules Library (read for all firm users): Current Rules (GET /v1/rules; filter by
+domain, effective dates, source link, status incl. pending_verification, and
+whether the row is a shared default, firm override or engagement override); Version
+history per rule_key; "Upload FTA PDF" for Tax Partner and Admin only (POST
+/v1/rules-monitor/upload; show the returned alert and proposals as drafts, not
+decisions); Verification checklist view (Appendix D)
+showing which shared default rules are still unverified for this firm (from GET
+/v1/firm/rules/review status=awaiting_firm_approval).
+Decisions: every rule row has "Review for my firm" linking to Partner Review (page 11)
+filtered to that rule_key. There, Tax Partner approves tax rules (VAT, INPUT_VAT, CT,
+TRN, LEGAL_REF) and Partner approves methodology rules; Approve / Override / Reject
+each need a mandatory comment. Admin, Manager, Senior and Staff see no approve
+buttons; Manager may propose an override. Shared defaults are never edited by a firm.
+Approved versions read-only. Dashboard warning while any rule is unverified for the
+firm. Skip Update Alerts, AI summaries, Watched sources and "Check FTA now" for now.
