+- PUT /v1/uploads/{dataset_id}/chunks/{index}: Send one chunk (raw bytes, index from 0). Returns ChunkAck: dataset_id, index, chunks_received
+- POST /v1/uploads/{dataset_id}/complete: Assemble chunks, compute SHA-256 and start the parse job. Body (application/json) UploadComplete: mapping_override?, sha256?. Returns 202 DatasetAccepted: dataset_id, job_id, sha256, mapping_suggestion, profile, status
+- POST /v1/datasets: Upload a GL or TB file (async: returns job id, mapping, SHA-256). Body (multipart/form-data) Body_upload_dataset_v1_datasets_post: engagement_id, file, kind?, mapping_override?. Returns 202 DatasetAccepted: dataset_id, job_id, sha256, mapping_suggestion, profile, status
+- GET /v1/datasets/{dataset_id}: Get Dataset. Returns DatasetOut: id, engagement_id, file_name, kind, status, sha256, size_bytes, rows, total_dr, total_cr, mapping, profile, created_at
+- PUT /v1/datasets/{dataset_id}/mapping: Override the header mapping and re-parse. Body (application/json) MappingUpdate: mapping_override. Returns 202 JobAccepted: job_id, dataset_id, status
