+- GET /v1/jobs: List jobs you can see. Query: engagement_id?, status?, type?, offset?, limit?. Returns JobsPage: total, offset, limit, items
+- GET /v1/jobs/{job_id}: Status and progress of a job. Returns JobOut: id, type, engagement_id?, status, progress, error, result_ref, created_at, started_at, finished_at
+- POST /v1/jobs/{job_id}/cancel: Cancel a job. Returns JobOut: id, type, engagement_id?, status, progress, error, result_ref, created_at, started_at, finished_at
+- POST /v1/sample: Create Sample. Body (application/json) SampleCreate: dataset_id, method?, basis?, account_types?, account_codes?, confidence?, tolerable_misstatement?, expected_misstatement_pct?, size_formula?, sample_size?, key_item_threshold?, strata_boundaries?, num_strata?, seed?. Returns 201 SampleOut: sample_id, dataset_id, engagement_id, method, status, parameters, cf_value, cf_rule_version, formula_text, n_required, sample_size, seed, random_start, interval, basic_precision, population, top_stratum, key_items, credit_lines_excluded, strata, items, warnings, rationale, engine_version, dataset_hash, rule_versions_used, rules_pending_verification
+- GET /v1/samples/{sample_id}: Read Sample. Returns SampleOut: sample_id, dataset_id, engagement_id, method, status, parameters, cf_value, cf_rule_version, formula_text, n_required, sample_size, seed, random_start, interval, basic_precision, population, top_stratum, key_items, credit_lines_excluded, strata, items, warnings, rationale, engine_version, dataset_hash, rule_versions_used, rules_pending_verification
+- POST /v1/je-tests: Run journal-entry tests (ISA 240) as a background job. Body (application/json) JeRunCreate: dataset_id, parameters?. Returns 202 JeRunAccepted: je_run_id, job_id, status_url, result_url
+- GET /v1/je-tests/{run_id}: JE test run result. Returns JeRunOut: je_run_id, status, job_id?, dataset_id, engagement_id
+- GET /v1/je-tests/{run_id}/flags: Flagged lines of a run, paginated. Query: flag?, min_score?, offset?, limit?
+- POST /v1/benford: Benford first-digit test. Body (application/json) BenfordCreate: dataset_id, account_types?, min_amount?. Returns BenfordOut: dataset_id, n, mad, conclusion, chart
+- POST /v1/vat-check: Output VAT and TRN checks. Body (application/json) VatCheckCreate: dataset_id, sides?. Returns VatCheckOut: dataset_id, exceptions_count
+- POST /v1/evaluate: Evaluate a sample (ISA 450). Body (application/json) EvaluateCreate: sample_id, method?, tolerable_misstatement?, items?. Returns EvaluationOut: sample_id, method, conclusion
+- POST /v1/workpaper: Generate the Excel working paper (ISA 230). Body (application/json) WorkpaperCreate: engagement_id, wp_ref, sample_id?, je_run_id?, input_vat_run_id?, reviewer?, stale_overrides?. Returns 201 WorkpaperOut: workpaper_id, wp_ref, status, sha256, file_url
+- POST /v1/workpaper/jobs: Generate the working paper as a background job (large exports). Body (application/json) WorkpaperCreate: engagement_id, wp_ref, sample_id?, je_run_id?, input_vat_run_id?, reviewer?, stale_overrides?
+- GET /v1/workpapers/{workpaper_id}: Get Workpaper. Returns WorkpaperOut: workpaper_id, wp_ref, status, sha256, file_url
+- GET /v1/workpapers/{workpaper_id}/file: Download Workpaper
+- POST /v1/ai/observation: Draft an observation with AI from an anonymised payload. Body (application/json) ObservationCreate: sample_item_id, failed_attribute, test?, remark?, rule_keys?. Returns 201 ObservationOut: observation_id, ai_generated
+- GET /v1/observations/{observation_id}: Get Observation. Returns ObservationOut: observation_id, ai_generated
+- POST /v1/observations/{observation_id}/review: Review Observation. Body (application/json) ObservationReview: text?. Returns ObservationOut: observation_id, ai_generated
+- GET /v1/rules: List rule versions. Query: rule_key?, domain?, status?
+- GET /v1/rules/resolve/{rule_key}: The single version of a rule effective on a date. Query: on?, engagement_id?. Returns RuleOut: ref, rule_key, version, status
+- POST /v1/rules/proposals: Propose Rule. Body (application/json) RuleProposal: rule_key, value, effective_from, effective_to?, source_url?, source_ref?, unit?, comment?. Returns 201 RuleOut: ref, rule_key, version, status
