+- POST /v1/firm/rules/{rule_key}/reject: Reject one of your firm's rule proposals. Body (application/json) FirmRuleReject: version_id, comment. Returns RuleOut: ref, rule_key, version, status
+- POST /v1/firms: Register a firm (platform Admin). Body (application/json) FirmCreate: id, name, require_approved_rules?
+- PUT /v1/firms/{firm_id}/clients/{client_id}: Link an unassigned client to a firm (platform Admin)
